{"name": "Undying Soul", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Undying Soul is a fast-paced 2D action roguelite where you fight through a brutal world with a roster of unique playable characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Different Playable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/9a034956fdc7c3dec8303f73a84bb867.poster.avif?t=1790089232\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/9a034956fdc7c3dec8303f73a84bb867.webm?t=1790089232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/9a034956fdc7c3dec8303f73a84bb867.mp4?t=1790089232\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carry two characters at a time, each with their own weapons, abilities, stats and playstyles. Swap between them during combat to exploit their strengths, adapt to different situations, and change the flow of a fight. As new characters become available throughout a run, replace your current lineup and discover new combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create Broken Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/2e1b42b621f2a04bfbcc82302b8da8d9.poster.avif?t=1790089232\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/2e1b42b621f2a04bfbcc82302b8da8d9.webm?t=1790089232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/2e1b42b621f2a04bfbcc82302b8da8d9.mp4?t=1790089232\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items, upgrades and relics that interact with your characters and abilities. Experiment with powerful synergies and create builds that can completely change how you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Allies Can Become Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/f665abe44f37fa0e75cdc1950261ac2e.poster.avif?t=1790089232\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/f665abe44f37fa0e75cdc1950261ac2e.webm?t=1790089232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/f665abe44f37fa0e75cdc1950261ac2e.mp4?t=1790089232\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters you can recruit may also stand in your way. Some can appear as dangerous minibosses, forcing you to fight against their unique abilities and combat styles before they can join your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face Ancient Guardians</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/289c59b41f988c7e8eb1cec82731643c.poster.avif?t=1790089232\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/289c59b41f988c7e8eb1cec82731643c.webm?t=1790089232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/extras/289c59b41f988c7e8eb1cec82731643c.mp4?t=1790089232\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of every chapter, a powerful guardian awaits. Each guardian protects a fragment of your shattered soul and demands a different strategy to overcome. Defeat them all to restore what was lost and bring your shattered soul back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Undying Soul is a 2D action roguelite focused on fluid combat, character swapping, and broken build crafting. Choose your allies, combine their abilities, discover powerful synergies and adapt your playstyle to overcome deadly foes and reclaim your shattered soul.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4949360/83609c58d5280efd9cd367533225bf1805158a0b/header.jpg?t=1790089232", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelite", "Action Roguelike", "Indie", "Action", "Pixel Graphics", "2D"], "developers": "MipuDevs", "publishers": "MipuDevs", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4949360", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "22 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/khr_1k-0mSs", "first_seen": 1790028000.0, "review_rank": 14}